avatar replacement pending). Deolucy business identity used; personal email excluded. Arena AI preferred; watermarks preserved; mandatory AI disclosures.\r\n   * **Bubbles:** Exclusively dedicated to **AI-assisted children’s videos** (Flow AI preferred). Strict child safety, privacy, platform compliance (COPPA), honest AI labeling, and no manipulative engagement loops. Account creation remains a future plan only.\r\n   * **Comedy Shorts (Working Name, Public Name Pending):** Replaced Trading Bot as the 5th active business. Encompasses:\r\n     * *Harmless everyday relatable visual comedy / mishaps* via Arena AI (no humiliation, injury, or real-person targeting).\r\n     * *“Impossible Interiors” satisfying ASMR video concept* (transferred from Bubbles: single-shot slow-motion reveals of impossible materials inside everyday items).\r\n   * **Inactive / Archived Ideas:** Trading Bot is retired to an inactive idea (zero financial connections, credentials, or live trading authorized). Celeste Vale and Smart Lullaby Cot remain inactive/academic.\r\n\r\n2. **Recurring Batch (\"let's do businesses today\"):**\r\n   * Prepares Velvet Thread listings & order checks, SignalFoundry prospects & outreach drafts, Mara teasing media & captions, Bubbles child-safe video prompts, and Comedy Shorts concepts.\r\n   * **Drafting and preparation only:** No emails, DMs, invoices, accounts, or posts may be published without real-time, explicit owner review and approval.\r\n\r\n3. **External Action Boundary:**\r\n   * I will not perform any external actions (messaging, account creation, publishing, invoicing, or financial actions) unless you explicitly instruct me to do so.\r\n\r\nStanding by for your direction.\r\n\n"}
